    {
      "statement": "The research demonstrates that smart home agents can manage power load balance and device recovery in a live environment.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "A suite of simulations was conducted to measure the resilience of smart home agents before, during, and after power outages.",
      "confidence": 0.95
